{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(string_list: list, pattern_list: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if two lists follow the same pattern based on a consistent bijective mapping.\n    Returns True if a consistent bijective mapping can be established, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(string_list) != len(pattern_list):\n        return False\n\n    string_to_pattern_map = {}\n    pattern_to_string_map = {}\n\n    for i in range(len(string_list)):\n        s_char = string_list[i]\n        p_char = pattern_list[i]\n\n        if s_char in string_to_pattern_map:\n            if string_to_pattern_map[s_char] != p_char:\n                return False\n        else:\n            string_to_pattern_map[s_char] = p_char\n\n        if p_char in pattern_to_string_map:\n            if pattern_to_string_map[p_char] != s_char:\n                return False\n        else:\n            pattern_to_string_map[p_char] = s_char\n\n    return True"}
