{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(list_of_tuples: list[tuple[int, ...]], k: int) -> list[tuple[int, ...]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters a list of tuples, returning only those where all elements are divisible by k.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _is_tuple_divisible_by_k(tup: tuple[int, ...], k: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"\n        Checks if all elements in the given tuple are divisible by k.\n        \"\"\"\n        if k == 0:\n            return False\n        for element in tup:\n            if element % k != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    result_list = []\n    for current_tuple in list_of_tuples:\n        if _is_tuple_divisible_by_k(current_tuple, k):\n            result_list.append(current_tuple)\n    return result_list"}
