{"task_id": "Mbpp/95", "solution": "def Find_Min_Length(list_of_lists: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the length of the smallest list in a list of lists.\n    Returns 0 if list_of_lists is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return 0\n    min_length = float('inf')\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        min_length = min(min_length, len(sublist))\n    return min_length"}
