{"task_id": "Mbpp/97", "solution": "from typing import List, Any, Dict\ndef frequency_lists(nested_list: List[List[Any]]) -> Dict[Any, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the frequency of each element in a flattened list of lists.\n\n    Returns a dictionary where keys are unique elements and values are their frequencies.\n    \"\"\"\n    flattened_list = []\n    for inner_list in nested_list:\n        for item in inner_list:\n            flattened_list.append(item)\n\n    frequency_map = {}\n    for item in flattened_list:\n        frequency_map[item] = frequency_map.get(item, 0) + 1\n            \n    return frequency_map"}
