{"task_id": "Mbpp/100", "solution": "def _is_palindrome(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if an integer is a palindrome by comparing its string representation with its reverse.\"\"\"\n    s = str(n)\n    return s == s[::-1]\ndef next_smallest_palindrome(input_integer: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the next smallest palindrome strictly greater than the specified integer.\"\"\"\n    current_number = input_integer + 1\n    while True:\n        if _is_palindrome(current_number):\n            return current_number\n        current_number += 1"}
