{"task_id": "Mbpp/111", "solution": "from typing import Any, List, Set\ndef common_in_nested_lists(nested_list: List[List[Any]]) -> Set[Any]:\n    \"\"\"Finds common elements in given nested lists.\n\n    Args:\n        nested_list: A list of lists, where each inner list contains elements.\n\n    Returns:\n        A set of elements that are present in all inner lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not nested_list:\n        return set()\n\n    common_set = set(nested_list[0])\n\n    if not common_set:\n        return set()\n\n    for inner_list in nested_list[1:]:\n        common_set = common_set.intersection(set(inner_list))\n        if not common_set:\n            break\n\n    return common_set"}
