{"task_id": "Mbpp/256", "solution": "def count_Primes_nums(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of prime numbers strictly less than the given non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    def _is_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a given number is prime.\"\"\"\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        i = 2\n        while i * i <= n:\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n            i += 1\n        return True\n\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(2, num):\n        if _is_prime(i):\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
