{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def _factorial(x: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer x.\"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return 1\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(1, x + 1):\n        result *= i\n    return result\ndef _binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k) using factorials.\"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    return _factorial(n) // (_factorial(k) * _factorial(n - k))\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even index binomial coefficients C(n, k) for a positive integer n.\n    This sums C(n, 0) + C(n, 2) + C(n, 4) + ...\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return total_sum"}
