{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum(list_of_numbers: list[int], length: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the largest contiguous sublist using Kadane's algorithm.\n    It efficiently tracks the maximum sum ending at the current position and the overall maximum sum found so far.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_so_far = list_of_numbers[0]\n    current_max = list_of_numbers[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, length):\n        current_max = max(list_of_numbers[i], current_max + list_of_numbers[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n\n    return max_so_far"}
