{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(array: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses the elements of the input array from the beginning up to the k-th position (1-indexed).\n    Performs an in-place reversal using a two-pointer approach.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not array or k < 1 or k > len(array):\n        return array\n\n    left = 0\n    right = k - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        array[left], array[right] = array[right], array[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n\n    return array"}
