{"task_id": "Mbpp/734", "solution": "def sum_Of_Subarray_Prod(input_list: list[int]) -> int:\n    # Calculates the sum of products of all possible sublists.\n    # It iterates through all possible start and end indices to generate sublists.\n    total_sum = 0\n    n = len(input_list)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_product = 1\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_product *= input_list[j]\n            total_sum += current_product\n    return total_sum"}
