{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(input_list: list, rotation_count: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Rotates a list to the right by the specified number of items.\n\n    Calculates the effective rotation and uses slicing to move elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    effective_rotation = rotation_count % len(input_list)\n    return input_list[-effective_rotation:] + input_list[:-effective_rotation]"}
